    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "7367AD6BF5A9CC6A",
      "text": "열심히 할 거예요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "7367AC6BF5A9CAB7",
      "text": "꼭 이길 거예요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_select_03",
      "hash64": "7367AB6BF5A9C904",
      "text": "불안해요...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_04a",
      "hash64": "E847044310E52647",
      "text": "오우~! 땡큐베리감사~!\\n나는 솔직한 코멘트가 좋더라~![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_04b",
      "hash64": "E847054310E527FA",
      "text": "올~! 멘트 좋은데~?\\n이래야 인플루언서지~![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_04c",
      "hash64": "E847064310E529AD",
      "text": "호오, 자신감 없는 컨셉으로 나오시겠다?\\n우히히! 재밌는 컨셉이네~![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_denki_05",
      "hash64": "CA09298CCE9AB92F",
      "text": "그럼 이제 슬슬...\\n모야모의 배틀, 보고 싶은 사람~?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_comment_01",
      "hash64": "AD2819F84BC32C31",
      "text": "저요 저요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_comment_02",
      "hash64": "AD2816F84BC32718",
      "text": "기다리고 있었다구!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_comment_03",
      "hash64": "AD2817F84BC328CB",
      "text": "배틀! 배틀!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_denki_040_comment_04",
      "hash64": "AD281CF84BC3314A",
      "text": "일렉킹 님이 [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]5000원[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] 후원",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
